## NFCorpus Live Retrieval Diagnostics Workbench — Complete

### Files Created

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `app.py` | Flask backend: Anserini CLI wrapper, search/eval endpoints, readiness checks |
| `templates/index.html` | Full dashboard UI with readiness panel, live search, eval comparison, commands/artifacts tabs |
| `Dockerfile` | Render-ready container with Java 21, Anserini 2.1.1 fatjar, CACM smoke test, NFCorpus index pre-warm |
| `requirements.txt` | Python dependencies (Flask, gunicorn) |
| `README.md` | Full deployment docs, metric table, test instructions |
| `tests/test_browser.py` | Playwright E2E browser test (19 tests across 5 test classes) |
| `.gitignore` | Excludes jars, caches, run files, pycache |

### Verified End-to-End (All Passed)

- **Readiness**: Java 21, fatjar, CACM smoke test (MAP=0.3123, P30=0.1942), NFCorpus index
- **Live Search**: 3 distinct queries return different ranked results with doc IDs, scores, and full-text content from real Anserini commands
- **BM25 Evaluation**:

  | Metric | Expected | Observed | Status |
  |--------|----------|----------|--------|
  | nDCG@10 | 0.3218 | 0.3218 | PASS |
  | R@100 | 0.2457 | 0.2457 | PASS |
  | R@1000 | 0.3704 | 0.3704 | PASS |

- **Commands**: All 7 Anserini CLI invocations recorded (setup, search, eval)
- **Artifacts**: TREC run file path tracked
- **Health**: `GET /health` returns correct JSON with all required fields
- **Deployment contract**: Binds `0.0.0.0:${PORT:-10000}`, documented in page and README

### Deployment

```bash
docker build -t nfcorpus-workbench .
docker run -p 10000:10000 nfcorpus-workbench
```

On Render: Docker web service at the repo root, health check path `/health`, auto-detected `PORT`.